{
  "language_code": "eng",
  "language_probability": 1.0,
  "text": "Summit reached. Five thousand meters. Atmospheric containment failing. We are inside the void singularity chamber. That event horizon is bending the light around the dais. Stay behind my bulwark. The radiation is climbing. He is draining the planetary geothermal grid into that core. One command and he could purge the civilian population. No guards, no drone army. Just him, waiting on that throne. He knew we would make it this far. We broke his tanks, his labs, and his fortress. Let him wait. That crown is coming off today. Beneath all that noise, I can hear them. Millions of people down below, still holding on, still singing for the dawn. You crawled out of the scrap heaps to kneel before me. Your insurrection ends here. Axiom Force dies tonight. Phase blades ready. Shields synchronized. Every scar brought us here. We finish this together. For every stolen name, every life the machine took. Axiom Force, draw your weapons. Strike down the commander.",
